<title>INDONESIA: Barito to pay 55 rupiah dividend.</title>
<headline>Barito to pay 55 rupiah dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian timber firm PT Barito Pacific Timber said on Monday it would pay a dividend of 55 rupiah per share for 1996 compared with 50 rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>Barito said in a statement that total dividend payment would amount to 77 billion rupiah, or 88.22 percent of Barito's 1996 net profit of 87.28 billion rupiah.</p>
<p>Barito posted a net profit of 70.12 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on September 1, Barito said.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
